WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,368
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,418 --> 00:00:05,622
This is Episode 44.

3
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:08,687
Maya wants to send her drawing across the sky.

4
00:00:08,737 --> 00:00:10,952
But a muddy blob is watching.

5
00:00:11,002 --> 00:00:12,198
Oh no!

6
00:00:12,248 --> 00:00:14,401
Here comes the scramble lock.

7
00:00:14,451 --> 00:00:15,502
Click!

8
00:00:15,552 --> 00:00:17,881
Her sun turns to squiggles.

9
00:00:17,931 --> 00:00:20,218
The mail cloud takes it away.

10
00:00:20,268 --> 00:00:22,047
The blob grabs it.

11
00:00:22,097 --> 00:00:23,439
Squiggles.

12
00:00:23,489 --> 00:00:25,143
Only squiggles.

13
00:00:25,193 --> 00:00:27,013
It cannot read a thing.

14
00:00:27,063 --> 00:00:28,540
Where is the key?

15
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,212
In the key house.

16
00:00:30,262 --> 00:00:32,394
The key never leaves home.

17
00:00:32,444 --> 00:00:33,568
Never.

18
00:00:33,618 --> 00:00:35,407
The drawing lands.

19
00:00:35,457 --> 00:00:37,245
Maya turns the key.

20
00:00:37,295 --> 00:00:39,614
Squiggles become the sun again.

21
00:00:39,664 --> 00:00:41,941
The blob pokes the key house.

22
00:00:41,991 --> 00:00:43,084
Bonk!

23
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:44,310
Solid.

24
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,536
Lock it.

25
00:00:45,586 --> 00:00:46,803
Send it.

26
00:00:46,853 --> 00:00:48,174
Unlock it.

27
00:00:48,224 --> 00:00:50,044
The key stays home.

28
00:00:50,094 --> 00:00:52,153
That is the scramble lock.

29
00:00:52,203 --> 00:00:54,283
Now you know KMS!

30
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
